{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kick and Hide is a fast-paced multiplayer experience based on the classic children's yard game kick the can but this time with abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One game consists of 5 rounds, where each round one player is the seeker and the rest are hiders. The seeker's job is to guard the ball, whereas the hiders have to kick it and remain undetected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hiders' objective is to throw the seeker off their game. Taunt them with sounds and remain hard-to-catch by switching hiding spots and staying active in the map! Win the round by collecting points from the hardest task in the game: kicking the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The seeker's job is hard; you need to spot the hiders and touch the ball to capture them. All this while ensuring the ball stays secure in its place. The hiders are numerous, so you must utilize your superior movement and various abilities to outsmart outmanoeuvre the hiders. But remember - if the ball gets kicked, you need to return it to its spot before capturing can continue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Actively look for the hiders to catch them all and win the round. But remember to always keep one eye on the ball - the hiders can be surprisingly close!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698510?t=1752666356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/57003e2b4b92c81d28d86c6b1564f9c581292847/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752666356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/7d6c47a4134bfd37cfa2d008c24848b3669da2c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752666356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/7d6c47a4134bfd37cfa2d008c24848b3669da2c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752666356","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kick and Hide is a fast-paced multiplayer experience based on the classic children's yard game kick the can but this time with abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One game consists of 5 rounds, where each round one player is the seeker and the rest are hiders. The seeker's job is to guard the ball, whereas the hiders have to kick it and remain undetected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hiders' objective is to throw the seeker off their game. Taunt them with sounds and remain hard-to-catch by switching hiding spots and staying active in the map! Win the round by collecting points from the hardest task in the game: kicking the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The seeker's job is hard; you need to spot the hiders and touch the ball to capture them. All this while ensuring the ball stays secure in its place. The hiders are numerous, so you must utilize your superior movement and various abilities to outsmart outmanoeuvre the hiders. But remember - if the ball gets kicked, you need to return it to its spot before capturing can continue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Actively look for the hiders to catch them all and win the round. But remember to always keep one eye on the ball - the hiders can be surprisingly close!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Stolen Heater"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/b9f9e55dde81406a946257b5d8823e5fa1cfdc0c/header.jpg?t=1752666356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257164566,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164566/movie48